    <briefdescription>
<para>This class represents a composition of other <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_c_e_v" kindref="compound">SCEV</ref> predicates, and is the class that most clients will interact with. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is equivalent to a logical &quot;AND&quot; of all the predicates in the union.</para>
<para>NB! Unlike other <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_c_e_v_predicate" kindref="compound">SCEVPredicate</ref> sub-classes this class does not live in the ScalarEvolution::Preds folding set. This is why the <computeroutput>add</computeroutput> function is sound. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
